{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967380/extras/16246d9a3739691e0252d3d646b50b2f.avif?t=1765136938\" width=618 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>DEAD DETENTION</strong></i> is a scribbly <i>coming-of-age\u00a0</i>visual novel that takes place entirely within a <i>bored high schooler's exercise book</i>. In it, you play as <i>Max</i>, a nerdy teen turned doomsday survivor, as he and his new friends try to <strong>get to safety!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967380/extras/9a8005ca50ab39542146b27d77196a65.avif?t=1765136938\" width=618 height=69 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14-year-old <strong>Max</strong> is given a detention for falling asleep in class--but a zombie outbreak suddenly interrupts it! Senior student <strong>Naomi </strong>saves him from a deadly attack, but can't leave campus without <strong>her lost sister Sora</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deciding to stay behind and help her, Max and Naomi begin their quest to find Sora, while struggling to <strong>survive the quickly spreading virus...</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967380/extras/36936bc7c12939d9c8437da893d0d392.avif?t=1765136938\" width=618 height=69 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape Max by making choices that are <strong>brave, scared, nice or mean</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All your choices will compound and lead to <strong>1 of 3 endings</strong>, including a special <strong>true ending</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967380/extras/214de7135615cd1b5636d9ed2ad9a80b.avif?t=1765136938\" width=618 height=69 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>quick microgames</strong> throughout the story to swing your bat, run from zombies, climb ladders, and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each episode builds to a fun <strong>boss challenge</strong>, such as target shooting and boxing!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features 3 difficulties, including an <strong>unlockable Hard Mode</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>DEAD DETENTION</i></strong> is a rescribbled and fully remade version of the cult flash series. It features <strong>5 episodes of chaotic fun</strong>, plus <strong>a special epilogue</strong> unlocked by achieving either of the good endings!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Episode 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967380/356c48229735e5bfea73ff5dc2ee4bc4ff0dbf7b.jpg"},{"name":"Episode 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967380/356c48229735e5bfea73ff5dc2ee4bc4ff0dbf7b.jpg"},{"name":"Episode 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967380/356c48229735e5bfea73ff5dc2ee4bc4ff0dbf7b.jpg"},{"name":"Episode 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967380/356c48229735e5bfea73ff5dc2ee4bc4ff0dbf7b.jpg"},{"name":"Episode 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967380/f528ed547626766b8c0418fda2fdd8517683cb63.jpg"},{"name":"True Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967380/b51bc8af55a8714043e38932c21c1e1b1ac6ec5c.jpg"},{"name":"Sad Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967380/b51bc8af55a8714043e38932c21c1e1b1ac6ec5c.jpg"},{"name":"After Story","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967380/356c48229735e5bfea73ff5dc2ee4bc4ff0dbf7b.jpg"},{"name":"Plot Tokens","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967380/328fb54409889db9baba2273ce936d7122862c08.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967380/328fb54409889db9baba2273ce936d7122862c08.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2967380?t=1765136938","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967380/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765136938","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967380/245f7b48b859017abb9cf1f85880eb75cdca2d97/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765136938","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967380/245f7b48b859017abb9cf1f85880eb75cdca2d97/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765136938","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967380/extras/16246d9a3739691e0252d3d646b50b2f.avif?t=1765136938\" width=618 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>DEAD DETENTION</strong></i> is a scribbly <i>coming-of-age\u00a0</i>visual novel that takes place entirely within a <i>bored high schooler's exercise book</i>. In it, you play as <i>Max</i>, a nerdy teen turned doomsday survivor, as he and his new friends try to <strong>get to safety!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967380/extras/9a8005ca50ab39542146b27d77196a65.avif?t=1765136938\" width=618 height=69 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14-year-old <strong>Max</strong> is given a detention for falling asleep in class--but a zombie outbreak suddenly interrupts it! Senior student <strong>Naomi </strong>saves him from a deadly attack, but can't leave campus without <strong>her lost sister Sora</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deciding to stay behind and help her, Max and Naomi begin their quest to find Sora, while struggling to <strong>survive the quickly spreading virus...</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967380/extras/36936bc7c12939d9c8437da893d0d392.avif?t=1765136938\" width=618 height=69 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape Max by making choices that are <strong>brave, scared, nice or mean</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All your choices will compound and lead to <strong>1 of 3 endings</strong>, including a special <strong>true ending</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967380/extras/214de7135615cd1b5636d9ed2ad9a80b.avif?t=1765136938\" width=618 height=69 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>quick microgames</strong> throughout the story to swing your bat, run from zombies, climb ladders, and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each episode builds to a fun <strong>boss challenge</strong>, such as target shooting and boxing!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features 3 difficulties, including an <strong>unlockable Hard Mode</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>DEAD DETENTION</i></strong> is a rescribbled and fully remade version of the cult flash series. It features <strong>5 episodes of chaotic fun</strong>, plus <strong>a special epilogue</strong> unlocked by achieving either of the good endings!</p>","developers":["Jack Astral"],"dlc":[3032710],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967380/69a7287ce6c89dca43747e0f156db62291156cb5/header.jpg?t=1765136938","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2967380/372374859/813c79052eb395d03d7d4473fe81d6b30c395c7c/1765130120/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765136937","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2967380/372374859/813c79052eb395d03d7d4473fe81d6b30c395c7c/1765130120/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765136937","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2967380/372374859/813c79052eb395d03d7d4473fe81d6b30c395c7c/1765130120/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765136937","id":257033071,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257033071/d1778270e94eeee90e642439bb9a8fe37f981bf8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765136937"}],"name":"Dead Detention (Rescribbled)","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Dead Detention (Rescribbled)